  "releaseNotes": "NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.CivicOASIS v2.0.3\n\nConnects the OASIS to Civic -- the on-chain identity and KYC platform powering Civic Pass on Solana and EVM. Enables OASIS avatars to hold verifiable on-chain identity credentials without exposing personal data. Part of the OASIS HOT-Swappable Provider Architecture. Ecosystem: https://oasisomniverse.one\n\nWhat's new since v2.0.2\n- docs: add README.md for 57 providers + bump submodule pointers (87b2b85)\n- feat: add 11 new OASIS providers — Maps (4), Blockchain (2), Network (3), Storage (2) (e1538d7)\n- feat(CivicOASIS): read Civic Pass gateway tokens on-chain (f234334)\n- fix: resolve all build errors in 11 new OASIS providers (2d0a601)\n\nFull changelog\nhttps://github.com/NextGenSoftwareUK/OASIS/commits/master/Providers/Network/NextGenSoftware.OASIS.API.Providers.CivicOASIS",
